{{Headline|22|In Other News}}


*Worlds 101 and 107 are no longer Deadman worlds.
*The points for unlocking the barrier in the tightrope room have been adjusted.
*The message "You scratch a notch on your bow" from Chompy/Jubbly hunting has been added to the spam filter.
*Talking to the Herbiboar pet while in the menagerie no longer shows the chathead of the Jal-Nib-Rek.
*Some unnecessary push tiles have been removed from the Cave network in Monkey Madness 2.
*Hoop Snakes can now be rolled outside of Fossil Island.

